From b41590d462f2c99a4513f8c6d34f009d42230a97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlessandroRCL <alessandro.1901.ramiro@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:01:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(consumption): add period report, comparison, cost,
 recommendations, sharing and goals (US21-US23, US25-US27)

The period report returns the accumulated consumption by Water Point with a
referential cost from the tariff of the service category (US21, US23), saving
recommendations based on a 30-day baseline (US25) and the progress of the monthly
reduction goal (US27). The comparison measures the variation against the previous
period (US22) and the share endpoint returns a localized summary (US26).
